{"id":37421256973,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAItnsRDQ","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-22217-collection-replace-diff_2.43","head_sha":"241ee4817f334240e0a9cca9637d313796864d96","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":53358,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"backport: fix: Only apply the difference when replacing collection items [DHIS2-22217]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":101361156299,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAXmZiAyw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973","pull_requests":[{"id":4754774732,"number":25492,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25492","head":{"ref":"fix/DHIS2-22217-collection-replace-diff_2.43","sha":"241ee4817f334240e0a9cca9637d313796864d96","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.43","sha":"7ca906184b07f38740dddaae7b4012f9f538b6bb","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-10-06T05:58:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:10:42Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-06T05:58:47Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/101361156299","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/37421256973/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: Only apply the difference when replacing collection items [DHIS2-22217] (#25479)\n\n* fix: Only apply the difference when replacing collection items [DHIS2-22217]\n\nPUT /api/{type}/{uid}/{property} removed every item in the collection and\nthen added every requested item back, even when the list was unchanged.\nFor non-owned collections such as OrganisationUnit.dataSets and\nOrganisationUnit.programs, each touched item loads and updates its full\nowning collection (DataSet.sources, Program.organisationUnits). On a large\ninstance, re-sending an org unit's unchanged data sets loaded hundreds of\nthousands of org units, took 4 to 9 s, set a new lastUpdated on every data\nset and program, and failed with HTTP 500 when the transaction hit the idle\nin transaction timeout. The Metadata Management app sends these PUTs on\nevery org unit save.\n\nreplaceCollectionItems now compares the current and requested UIDs and\nonly removes and adds the difference, so an unchanged list touches nothing.\nThe collection endpoints also only clear the Hibernate caches when the\nupdate actually changed something.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* fix: Reload the object before diffing a non-owned collection\n\nFor a non-owned property such as OrganisationUnit.dataSets, the replace\ndiff reads the inverse collection, which is in the second-level cache\nand is not evicted when only the owning side (DataSet.sources) changes:\non another cluster node, after an out-of-band change, or when a reader\ncaches it during a metadata import. A stale copy made a re-sent item\nlook unchanged, so the PUT returned 200 with nothing updated and the\nlink stayed missing.\n\nRefresh the object first so the inverse collection is read from the\ndatabase. Evicting the cache entry alone is not enough, as the\ncollection is already loaded into the session by then. An unchanged PUT\nnow runs 3 statements instead of 1 (the object's row and its inverse\ncollection), still independent of the size of the owning collections.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"241ee4817f334240e0a9cca9637d313796864d96","tree_id":"f5affd5fceafaf50849f95191d5e97e53e7580e4","timestamp":"2026-10-06T05:58:38Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/comments{/number}","co